          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamusmo tseereedá' gari tikiis ar diitsarós gari sliik gawaá xareemaá kitángw ilahhooár da/a/aangw. Tseerér aa met gari ku'uus dír gwe'eedaá kitángw ilahhooa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahhna sleémeero ar leeidá' gari hingees, adór tidár aaraá ta ilahhooár wayduú wa hanmiisi, ka /imaamiisi. Kaahamusmo gari daa/ gawaá kitángw ilahhooa, slaahhareeriiwós AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nguri sla'atisiyá'. Kaahamusmo haraki/isa gari tleehh as daanduú heewí, heewí kuri gurtláy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
